ive price/cost position with respect to tariffs and saw the benefit of roughly 5 points of price in the quarter from our previously announced tariff-related pricing actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/zurn-elkay-zws-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ZWS 2025 Q4","e":"zws","d":"2026-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Pauli","x":"In terms of price, we will have higher price impact in H1 as by the second half, we cycle against quarters that already have the tariff-related price realized.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/zurn-elkay-zws-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ZWS 2025 Q4","e":"zws","d":"2026-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Adam Farley","x":"And then looking at the 2026 guide, given some of the more recent increases in metal prices and continued general inflation, I mean, do you think you need to or maybe already have been out to the market with additional price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/zurn-elkay-zws-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ZWS 2025 Q4","e":"zws","d":"2026-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Todd Adams","x":"I think any price increases that we've put in place this year, Jeff, are sort of back to normal course.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/zurn-elkay-zws-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ZWS 2026 Q1","e":"zws","d":"2026-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Todd Adams","x":"Next, there's been a lot of announcements in moving parts related to tariffs over the course of the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/zurn-elkay-zws-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ZWS 2026 Q1","e":"zws","d":"2026-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Todd Adams","x":"The Supreme Court ruling on the [indiscernible] tariffs and subsequent refunds, the implementation of 122 tariffs changes to the 232 tariff scheme a